<title>USA: Williams Controls names Herlihy as CFO.</title>
<headline>Williams Controls names Herlihy as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Controls Inc said Thursday it had named Gerard Herlihy to the position of chief financial officer and to the newly created post of chief administrative officer.</p>
<p>As CFO, Herlihy succeeds Dale Nelson, who will remain controller and assume the CFO duties of Williams's new Industrial Products Group, which consists of the vehicle components and electrical components businesses.</p>
